# idea-creator.manifest.result.json (Step 2)

Write: `idea-stage/idea-creator.manifest.result.json`  
Same keys and nesting as `aris-constraints/idea-creator.manifest.example.json` (replace example values).

## result

- `"success"` — all rules below met  
- `"failed"` — otherwise (still write the file)

## Top-level fields

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| aris_phase | `"idea-creator"` |
| report_path | `"idea-stage/IDEA_REPORT.md"` |
| inputs.research_brief | `"RESEARCH_BRIEF.md"` |
| inputs.prior_research_lit_manifest | `"idea-stage/research-lit.manifest.result.json"` |
| finished_at | UTC ISO-8601 |
| ideas_evaluated.generated | integer **≥ 8** for `success` |
| ideas_evaluated.survived_filtering | integer |
| ideas_evaluated.piloted | **0** when pilots skipped |
| ideas_evaluated.recommended | **3** for `success` |
| ideas | array **length 3**, ranks **1, 2, 3** |

## ideas[] (each of 3 entries)

| Field | Required for success |
|-------|----------------------|
| id | string |
| rank | 1, 2, or 3 |
| title | non-empty; must match report heading (see IDEA_REPORT) |
| one_line_pitch | string |
| method_steps | non-empty string array |
| hypothesis | string |
| minimum_experiment | string |
| novelty_claim | string |
| feasibility | string |
| risk | string (e.g. LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH) |
| pilot_result | `"SKIPPED"` when no pilot run |
| key_papers | string array of `papers[].id` from research-lit manifest only |

## IDEA_REPORT.md (composed)

File: `idea-stage/IDEA_REPORT.md` (same as manifest `report_path`).

For `result=success`:

1. MUST include this markdown H2 line exactly:

       ## Recommended Ideas (ranked)

2. For **each** manifest `ideas[]` entry, MUST include exactly one heading line:

       ### Idea {rank}: {title}

   where `{rank}` is `ideas[].rank` and `{title}` is **byte-for-byte identical** to `ideas[].title`.
